{"title":"1988 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, be non-zero natural numbers that verify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/480f23540283ee3388f3df9f5cbc6e1ff553bcff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad-bc=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99098e20639900d11ad44174988f1bac7b6726c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} &gt;\\frac{p}{q}&gt;\\frac{c}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Prove:\n</p><p>(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/a/f0a3d3610b739c80c53d1e98fb075ffa3b15d495.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q \\ge b+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>(ii) If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea5c9f27287d609541c881a8f550e0eb3d9370b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=b+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa9ec20948a2ed4c3c43073ee7bad5b7d26a2a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=a+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p><p>Consider the matrix:\n</p><p>\\begin{pmatrix}\na &amp; b \\\\\nc &amp; d\n\\end{pmatrix}\n</p><p>It is invertible since the determinant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/89358699ebc07a4aa93aae0f2e9bc10906f88534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad-bc \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> and thus forms a basis for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a62d72646c467ae02878bc6dd7138e087a13c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{R}^2$\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore we have a unique solution to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78cfadd68ff661bf7fa429c7bcc2912f0079b5e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = xa + yb$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f8d643783577320b0266b633e8596b042a36e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = xc + yd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Solving this gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/d/33d89943f1253c85172f93ea4f28496c5a3dec7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = aq - bp$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/6/52685286639f97a44af038fac470786a7084e1d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = pd - cq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />. Using the inequality given, we realise that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0517387c7374eb6cfeae1fb2084bf2b52a7303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> and thus are positive integers which have a minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> each. \nPlugging this into the above, i.e when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31348a5b421999b2a557ea16be9f1933402a423a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y) = (1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />, we get both (i) and (ii).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe3.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe3.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017181046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3540/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.374      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.374      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26051:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017181046 and revision id 291966. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}